From dd79bcad2789290acd3c3e03cf6db9bd87331f28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xiang Xu <xuxiang@eswincomputing.com>
Date: Mon, 30 Jun 2025 19:20:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 589/652] perf: Optimize CPU voltage and cpufreq control

Changelogs:
1. Optimize CPU voltage control and cpufreq adjustment adaptation

Signed-off-by: Xiang Xu <xuxiang@eswincomputing.com>
---
 drivers/clk/eswin/clk.c | 96 +++++++++++++++++++++++------------------
 1 file changed, 54 insertions(+), 42 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/eswin/clk.c b/drivers/clk/eswin/clk.c
index 2569c06b4c0a7..18ece1f2da59c 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/eswin/clk.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/eswin/clk.c
@@ -1,6 +1,19 @@
 // SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
 /*
  * Copyright 2024, Beijing ESWIN Computing Technology Co., Ltd.. All rights reserved.
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
